     * {@value #PREMIUM_TIER_MIN_LEVEL}, otherwise {@code "STANDARD"}. AREA is {@code "METRO"} when the
     * owner's {@linkplain #resolveLocality locality} is a known region, otherwise {@code "REGIONAL"}.
     */
